    "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nWe need a banner that can be used as the privacy and cookie banner on canonical and the cookie banner on AMP.\r\n\r\nThe privacy banner:\r\n<img width=\"1287\" alt=\"Screen Shot privacy banner\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3028997/54110493-77e56f80-43d9-11e9-99cd-1016cb2fb799.png\">\r\n\r\nThe cookie banner:\r\n<img width=\"1285\" alt=\"Screen Shot cookie banner\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3028997/54110497-7a47c980-43d9-11e9-903e-90423624958c.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\n- Implement the component, matching the styles of the existing Privacy / Cookie Banner. We will not include the gear/tick icons in this MVP version. \r\n- AMP/Canonical conditional logic should be in the Consent Banner Container, added in a separate PR. \r\n- Do not integrate into the Article container in this ticket. \r\n- See CookieBanner component for Canonical proof of concept: https://github.com/bbc/simorgh/pull/1336/files#diff-d51fea290710062195af8293a7eb7f13R1\r\nSee ConsentBanner component for AMP proof of concept: https://github.com/bbc/simorgh/pull/1306/files#diff-fb8f87665273f036db9aa5025de2a314 \r\nCookie \r\n\r\n\r\nExports from the component:\r\nConsentBannerButton component (e.g. with hover/focus styles)\r\nConsentBannerLink component (e.g. with hover/focus styles)\r\nConsentBanner component\r\nConsentBannerText component (we could generate a block with attributes like the Optimo Fragments, however we prefer for this MVP version to use three hard-coded strings e.g. text1, text2, text2Url, text3)\r\n\r\nWe need the component to be able to be used in four scenarios for AMP and Canonical, defined in these issues #1399 #1400\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n**Testing notes**\r\nRegression test the Privacy & Cookie banner component stories to make sure that the styles within Storybook match those that are currently within Orbit.\r\n\r\nDev insight: Jest snapshot tests should be sufficient, since this is creating the component and not integrating it into the article. We should have four storybook stories - for the Privacy banner and for the cookie banner, for both AMP and Canonical. \r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nAdd any other context or screenshots about the feature request here.\r\n\r\n- [x] Initially labelled with [\"Refinement needed\"](https://github.com/bbc/simorgh/labels/Refinement%20Needed)\r\n",
